        },
        {
          "text": "Toboŋokis ŋakipi ayakau lopite ŋolopei sek ayakatar, toburusiyasi ŋagaari ka toara ŋikametok kec kaapei ka ŋasigarya a Parao daadaŋ ŋuna sek ewuapito Ŋisirael alokidiŋ Anam, mam ipei daŋ abu kidoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
